### Key behaviors
- ApplyGuardrail source:'OUTPUT' on response text
- Emit Ai.GuardrailChecked per check (TEL-1)
- On reject: buildArRetryInstruction() injects finding feedback
- On double-fail: emitArRejected() with finalOutcome:'hitl-deferred'
- On HITL flag: emitArRejected() immediately (never retry ambiguous)
- Dormant when guardrail env vars absent (pre-deploy)
- Meters usage on every path (FIX-W-1 pattern in index.ts integration)

